  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:1c8e68c80f1b9223671e3160e3a7a3261c9c4e507cd606c9ff6e08b8dcc51d78",
      "request_id": "1c8e68c80f1b9223671e3160e3a7a3261c9c4e507cd606c9ff6e08b8dcc51d78",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0d13734c1730c2f55b942ea32af1f6e2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第五盘一比六，他与冠军擦肩。法网亚军的一千三百分，是他本季最大的一笔单站积分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3e281fe221f1f80622f091e53a63970b27a651561f3632da9d6be171b36de628",
      "words_sha256": "ac2bf306b52d15973e07b24adbe8bfa25554122dc42031d11ecf2494486bcadb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:358d85b31a6f2fee3804626a15d40b58d7dc69115da5a498d94c87d16b3242ec",
      "request_id": "358d85b31a6f2fee3804626a15d40b58d7dc69115da5a498d94c87d16b3242ec",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6a0f481e3b44feac0003e76dfca162c9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "门票在场外落定，通往都灵的路，是他一场场打出来的。第一次年终，在意大利的主场球迷面前，他还能走多远？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "93372ed88b1c4471354364fe32c1daf0bee487f15a98011d25f80dcb6320ea4b",
      "words_sha256": "16754e1adf1659a01dab2ef29d31c9d906d6840f0f22e82f97b5173ec589137b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:47629469d1f796d3b62ff0e959bf99f50f8fbdfc3ccbde8a72356fd0f77507f5",
      "request_id": "47629469d1f796d3b62ff0e959bf99f50f8fbdfc3ccbde8a72356fd0f77507f5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b840768967ab056dfcc3a9c71a5a8650",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "直到德尔雷海滩，他才又连续赢球，打进四强。接下来的阿卡普尔科，这一次，他把奖杯带走了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2095f64a13389f317559693c3004a9a8b18786e18afb71e6373d1d7980d9c612",
      "words_sha256": "90aed1741e464144cd508f4f3cbe272e9939ca1c78bc7fc45bca0eca5a1729f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:527be1915cf5459018b0ce02b789b8e0215033ac30a809449ae86ba7ef718bd4",
      "request_id": "527be1915cf5459018b0ce02b789b8e0215033ac30a809449ae86ba7ef718bd4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3734e9292691c4338212a6f0da8734cd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网首轮，两盘落后，他连扳三盘击败科梅萨尼亚。第二轮再逆转斯库尔凯特，第三轮输给布洛克斯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bd0d3be869b35fbcf1c7da88e76551402d575ff592a0548f611d82293b7391d8",
      "words_sha256": "a0e61962986b97e862aaf2b2d446718b1794e91ee81a691b1ba7637aa80e5e16"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:581e2ea32f66e5b96416674859ba26f2e17fe033a5a065416173d8b745fb1cfb",
      "request_id": "581e2ea32f66e5b96416674859ba26f2e17fe033a5a065416173d8b745fb1cfb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "36fe0da01cfa92e53ce40908993ac5a9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "马德里击败梅德韦杰夫，打进八强。罗马第三轮、汉堡首轮出局之后，他带着起伏来到巴黎。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "11081c89b3eb573d1ac8161920ab5e173580608b23a6f43d251d2ca2edbde627",
      "words_sha256": "dc4f7ec27909c7ddca7a1b56de3d7fd16b6cf2fff8515a7fdfac70344b8800d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:64d2d0fbf47d3f0416dd180fa935b3f4f4e33085e3382c643ea6df154fb28b4a",
      "request_id": "64d2d0fbf47d3f0416dd180fa935b3f4f4e33085e3382c643ea6df154fb28b4a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7a97ba7927a7251f554fc1e0957f6727",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "印第安维尔斯第三轮，迈阿密首战失利，蒙特卡洛第二轮。三月到四月，成绩仍有起伏。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d92800255c1803bb3cd0812a79bdb8801a1fa7d2619ae1148d8738a5d9ec00ad",
      "words_sha256": "b3d9cf65761af6fb81bc7e48af3f65da423e9b0c693d61c928891e9344e65d1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6ae2284d938f451a1361b1ba933dc77c541a7eced96bcf3f069112178d483fd0",
      "request_id": "6ae2284d938f451a1361b1ba933dc77c541a7eced96bcf3f069112178d483fd0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f5b368485373f269c33bfe066592b3c5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "里昂半决赛，穆塞蒂救下四个赛点，将科博利挡在决赛之外。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "240af618fc7fc09560ca8f2a144c84969d1d123b2a54f5cf504a1ecf951f0657",
      "words_sha256": "fa593efbda114fcd9d22f2677bfa837ca0347899c9bdc6f1b38adc5134abf758"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:78b12b634a7b6a184d6099e29fd0bd23c96a8825dba7444e651a7e51d976b69e",
      "request_id": "78b12b634a7b6a184d6099e29fd0bd23c96a8825dba7444e651a7e51d976b69e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0548119dcf95bc21df1b6bf09469ffe1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "哈雷首轮出局，温网又打进八强。第四轮三盘淘汰德米纳尔，四分之一决赛输给费里，连续第二年停在这里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3d5cc2130ca3aae02780e085bf20eb79d4780ba7aee78b9a9625efbca4c93bbe",
      "words_sha256": "5bb5e15d59aa42d8502a137160360c0fa0e26441cd20c2454835aa7603dd89e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:878822f0a3c45d06c25712c5b5abdb6c9a66bbe5de0294e87433c7059361d35f",
      "request_id": "878822f0a3c45d06c25712c5b5abdb6c9a66bbe5de0294e87433c7059361d35f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f3ee4e1c9898e0cef404ee5f6092dd99",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四月的慕尼黑，他在半决赛六比三、六比三击败兹维列夫。决赛输给谢尔顿，也拿到了三百三十分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7d22aa26192b49e2f3a84d3b3edb74f7f0ec09cb178d816c9cb04d3d896b2971",
      "words_sha256": "ff84193e2c5d4f650312ba855bcca3d9262997b61181145d6dad3d5fa29ae9aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8b70b99863d748c8e9d7db0a378fe1b0bc208964502215bbdb53686305fbeb91",
      "request_id": "8b70b99863d748c8e9d7db0a378fe1b0bc208964502215bbdb53686305fbeb91",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5806b412d4b85fc5e1c4447615d3bf01",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四分之一决赛逆转保罗，半决赛输给菲斯。四百分到手，科博利继续向第一次年终总决赛靠近。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "04fda7fc7e06039dbe50f2d60f39a46e524d0ea5ef873db5918642682d575a5d",
      "words_sha256": "990b961086cfe7c7ee8db3f21ea7bd52d13f9321bcc995a150ec08c65975b589"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a3b8c7e2a0cc3488f1758aefe76e770ac91937c676de3d622b4993e4dbb60581",
      "request_id": "a3b8c7e2a0cc3488f1758aefe76e770ac91937c676de3d622b4993e4dbb60581",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6ed674b2c181bde654fbb29c06baab16",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从联合杯到澳网，再到蒙彼利埃和达拉斯，四场单打连败。这个赛季，他的开局很难。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c134e4390daf25a7a1f1c5f1ecb2c9e8d6b5645b786a3d3a6e18987cf3b47f66",
      "words_sha256": "dad0193455a036d0bf878b339efa044c1ee1542d5fb78a7f7e7f59cfcfeca8d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a867cc087ad0e59d3bf9e7bbd63a24dd1ae571c1ada76adab417dc3d5de5fb43",
      "request_id": "a867cc087ad0e59d3bf9e7bbd63a24dd1ae571c1ada76adab417dc3d5de5fb43",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "60cb1387bbf62305f59aded5bdb52ecd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "乌马格和加拿大站都没赢球。来到辛辛那提，他连续四场打满三盘，第一次闯进大师赛四强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d8be93f56e2806dd37423eb5887595f496d240cb7eac77a190d1b61743233643",
      "words_sha256": "0dec5ab0fa921b6180068541edd419c52d14012f6ccaf8eb62bc2f8f826dc422"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ab9886b31c2b058ef9b256655bbf412b141dcbe2c7cc1a7a84fd3e33b5e06bd2",
      "request_id": "ab9886b31c2b058ef9b256655bbf412b141dcbe2c7cc1a7a84fd3e33b5e06bd2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "47852b515f0af2762bb4c5fbdb74823c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛七比六、六比四击败蒂亚福，拿下生涯首座硬帝巡回赛冠军。五百分到手，赛季终于有了亮色。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "99d40edf2418e4afb78af413d3c4481cfca37f73953fe0376e49ebdb2798b4bc",
      "words_sha256": "be67d97801961bc4ec31fbca51ff96719eb99b0da92b41fc8ffdbee7b0a43858"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5e79e5655e47efc2c0d3cee79eaeb80b9ff840b05900c74b39a6b72a62d8d70e",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
