        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他先连赢五场，打进四强。半决赛阿尔纳尔迪赛前退赛，科博利第一次站上大满贯决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "467914ed267ee49b0b9a9d3ae881ae9100561f6839ce3346e236e5aadb39bfbf",
      "words_sha256": "478420eb46ebc5e5702980696ccdb091ab87b29478cbcd80ea64ae6c181249f6"
    },
    {
